{"sections":[{"slug":"辛流形","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"辛流形"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">辛流形</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"辛流形"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">辛流形是经典力学</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">特别是</span> Hamilton <span lang=\"zh\">力学</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">常用的几何背景</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">辛流形是偶数维实流形</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其上有非退化的</span> $2$-<span lang=\"zh\">形式</span> $\\omega$, <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span> $d\\omega=0$, $\\omega^n\\neq 0$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">紧辛流形</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span> $H^2(M;\\mathbb{R})\\neq 0$.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">乘积辛形式</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">辛流形</span> $M,N$ <span lang=\"zh\">的乘积上的辛形式定义为</span>\n$$\r\n\\omega_{M\\times N} = \\pi_M^*\\omega_M - \\pi_N^*\\omega_N.\r\n$$</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">辛映射</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">光滑映射</span> $f\\colon M\\to N$ <span lang=\"zh\">为辛映射当且仅当</span> $\\Gamma f \\subset M\\times N$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Lagrange子流形","text":"Lagrange <span lang=\"zh\">子流形</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>Hamilton <span lang=\"zh\">向量场</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">给定函数</span> $H$ (<span lang=\"zh\">称为</span> Hamilton <span lang=\"zh\">函数</span>), <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span>\n$$\r\ni_X\\omega = - dH\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">的向量场</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">称作</span> $H$ <span lang=\"zh\">对应的</span> Hamilton <span lang=\"zh\">向量场</span>, $X_H$.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. Hamilton <span lang=\"zh\">向量场的流保持辛形式</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即</span>\n$$\r\n\\mathcal L_X\\omega =0.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">这是由于</span> Cartan <span lang=\"zh\">公式</span> $\\mathcal L_X\\omega = i_X d\\omega + di_X\\omega$.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. Hamilton <span lang=\"zh\">向量场的流保持对应的</span> Hamilton <span lang=\"zh\">量</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">这是因为</span>\n$$\r\ndH(X)=-\\omega(X,X)=0.\r\n$$</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">若向量场</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的流保持辛形式</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即</span> $\\mathcal L_X\\omega=0$, <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">局部上为</span> Hamilton <span lang=\"zh\">向量场</span>.</p>\n<h2>Poisson <span lang=\"zh\">括号</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">辛流形上的函数具有</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Poisson代数","text":"Poisson <span lang=\"zh\">括号</span>"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n\\{f,g\\}=X_f g = \\omega (X_f, X_g).\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">由定义立得</span></p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>.\n$$\r\n[X_f,X_g]=X_{\\{f,g\\}}.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>Hamilton G-<span lang=\"zh\">作用</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> Lie <span lang=\"zh\">群</span>. $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的伴随作用</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">左作用</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">诱导了其在</span> $\\mathfrak g^*$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的余伴随作用</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">右作用</span>)\n$$\r\n\\left&lt; \\operatorname{Ad}^*_g \\mu,\\xi\\right&gt; = \\left&lt; \\mu, \\operatorname{Ad}_g\\xi\\right&gt;.\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">现在设</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">左作用于流形</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">上</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">从而有映射</span>\n$$\r\n\\mathfrak g \\to \\operatorname{Vect}(M),\\quad \\xi \\mapsto \\xi^{\\#}.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">假设存在</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/动量映射","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">动量映射</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\Phi\\colon M\\to\\mathfrak g^*$, <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span>\n$$\r\ni_{\\xi^{\\#}}\\omega = - d \\left&lt;\\Phi(x),\\xi\\right&gt;.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">等变性</span>:\n$$\r\n\\Phi\\circ g = \\operatorname{Ad}^*_{g^{-1}}\\circ\\Phi.\r\n$$</p>\n<h3>Kirillov–Kostant <span lang=\"zh\">辛形式</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">考虑余伴随轨道</span> $\\mathcal O$, <span lang=\"zh\">其上有辛形式与</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/动量映射","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">动量映射</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $\\xi,\\eta\\in\\mathfrak g$, $\\mu\\in\\mathcal O$,\n$$\r\n\\omega(\\mu) (\\xi (\\mu), \\eta(\\mu)) = \\left&lt;\\mu,[\\xi,\\eta]\\right&gt;\r\n$$</p>\n<p>$\\mathfrak g^*$ <span lang=\"zh\">上有</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Poisson代数","text":"Poisson <span lang=\"zh\">结构</span>"}},{"Plain":":\n$$\r\n\\{f_1,f_2\\}(\\mu) := \\left&lt; \\mu, [df_1,df_2]\\right&gt;.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">可积系统</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/可积系统","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">可积系统</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $2n$ <span lang=\"zh\">维辛流形上有</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">个相互交换的</span> Hamilton <span lang=\"zh\">向量场</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即有</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">维圆环的作用</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}